  _name: Janitor Backstory
  Speaker: Janitor
  lines:
  - 'Detective: I need to confirm some information about you for my report.'
  - 'Antonio: What kind of information do you need?'
  - 'Detective: How about we start with your name, your age, and what you do around
    here.'
  - 'Antonio: Allright, I am Antonio Romano, age 40. I have been working here at
    the Smoke & Strings Bar as the janitor for the last 10 or so years.'
